        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">“I was again sexually molested and a family member (male, over 70) of mine played down my experience and denied that this is daily experience for many women in the world”</p></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "13/2/16/10",
              "zIndex": 8,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "17/17/20/24",
              "zIndex": 8,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/2-c1f8a3d9.png",
          "alt": "",
          "width": 1080,
          "height": 1080,
          "caption": "",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "17/3/20/5",
              "zIndex": 7,
              "justify": "center",
              "align": "center"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "21/21/25/24",
              "zIndex": 7,
              "justify": "center",
              "align": "center"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">“My concerns about an almost full lack of ecosystem related knowledge in local government was met with an 'it is what it is' statement by a member of the municipal council”</p></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "20/2/23/10",
              "zIndex": 9,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "25/20/29/26",
              "zIndex": 9,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/4-37328c64.png",
          "alt": "",
          "width": 1080,
          "height": 1080,
          "caption": "",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "24/2/27/4",
              "zIndex": 6,
              "justify": "center",
              "align": "center"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "30/11/34/14",
              "zIndex": 6,
              "justify": "center",
              "align": "center"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">“A conversation this morning with my turkish Airb&amp;b hosts in Berlin. The father explained how he doesn’t like the current prep for war. It stimulates hate, which enables war. He is thinking we should go about keeping peace differently than preparing for war. I shared an experience that when we meet a person it becomes impossible to hate them. This could be a way to peace..”</p></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "27/2/33/10",
              "zIndex": 9,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "30/14/35/22",
              "zIndex": 9,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/Untitled-design-d2ed074b.png",
          "alt": "",
          "width": 1080,
          "height": 1080,
          "caption": "",
          "layout": {
